SUMMARY:Twin Cities Santa Cycle Rampage 2026
LOCATION:New starting location to be announced\, Minneapolis\, MN
DESCRIPTION:Meet at 10 AM. New starting location to be announced. The Loop 
 will not be our starting point this year. Ride departure time will be anno
 unced when the schedule is settled. Dress festive and bring a new\, unwrap
 ped toy for kids in need. Come alone or bring a friend. The brewery-to-bre
 wery ride continues through the afternoon. Brewery stops and the final bre
 wery will be announced closer to ride day. The calendar blocks time throug
 h 5:30 PM as an estimate; the actual finish time may vary.\n\nWebsite and 
 ride updates: https://scrmsp.org\n\nFacebook RSVP (optional but appreciate
 d): https://www.facebook.com/events/1972798296683555/\n\nThe ride is free 
 and no registration is required. Ride at your own risk and follow traffic 
 laws. If you’re drinking, arrange a sober driver.
